# SAINTCON 2024 Wrist Badge ("Tower Battle") headless smoke script
# Drives boot -> onboarding registration -> main screen -> IR tower discovery -> stratagem battle

# 1. Boot splash screen (0..5.0s)
wait 1500
shot-screen 01-boot-splash

# 2. Finish splash transition -> onboarding screen on unregistered badge
wait 4200
shot-screen 02-onboarding

# Tap "Enter your handle" textarea, type handle on LVGL touch keyboard, and register
touch 180 115
wait 200
type-kb Player24
wait 200
tap-label Register
wait 300
tap-label OK
wait 400

# 3. Registered Main / Home screen (+ full wrist badge PCB composite)
shot-screen 03-main-home
shot-badge 03b-main-badge

# 4. Walk up to Tower 1 ("Communities") and Tower 4 ("Ballroom B") via NEC IR beacons
ir 1
wait 200
ir 4
wait 300

# Tap the flashing Tower alert icon in the bottom-left status bar (or open Tower Battle)
touch 20 220
wait 400
shot-screen 04a-tower-list

# Tap "Communities" tower to inspect its status & join modal
tap-label Communities
wait 400
shot-screen 04-tower-found

# 5. Join battle and launch Stratagem Attack UI
tap-label Join
wait 400
tap-label Attack
wait 400

# Enter first 2 stratagem arrows so mid-combo green progress is visible
solve-attack 2
wait 150
shot-screen 05-attack-battle
shot-badge 05b-attack-badge

# Complete remaining stratagem combos to verify POST /battle/stratagem + POST /battle/attack
solve-attack 32
wait 400
shot-screen 06-attack-result
